   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: flexTopology(t, algo) is the network the algorithm sees",
   "originalText": "How it works: flexTopology(t, algo) is the network the algorithm sees",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 38,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "flex_algo: [{ algo: 128, metric: delay, exclude_any: [red] }]\nlinks: affinity: [red], te_metric, delay (µs)   routers: algos: [128], algo_sids",
   "originalText": "flex_algo: [{ algo: 128, metric: delay, exclude_any: [red] }]\nlinks: affinity: [red], te_metric, delay (µs)   routers: algos: [128], algo_sids",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Routers: those that take part (algos, left out = all). Each gets its own Prefix-SID for the\n   algorithm: algo_sids, else its index + 1000 × the algorithm’s place in the list (128 first: +1000).\n•  Links: between taking-part routers, passing the colour rules (exclude-any, include-any,\n   include-all), and having the metric (no TE metric or delay → left out). Their cost is that metric.\n•  Everything else (SRGB, MSD, LFA policy, protection goal) is the network’s.",
   "originalText": "•  Routers: those that take part (algos, left out = all). Each gets its own Prefix-SID for the\n   algorithm: algo_sids, else its index + 1000 × the algorithm’s place in the list (128 first: +1000).\n•  Links: between taking-part routers, passing the colour rules (exclude-any, include-any,\n   include-all), and having the metric (no TE metric or delay → left out). Their cost is that metric.\n•  Everything else (SRGB, MSD, LFA policy, protection goal) is the network’s.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 331,
   "width": 490,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FRR stays inside the algorithm (RFC 9350 §6.1)",
   "originalText": "FRR stays inside the algorithm (RFC 9350 §6.1)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 365,
   "width": 819,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "So LFA, Remote LFA, TI-LFA, the simulation and coverage run unchanged on flexTopology.",
   "originalText": "So LFA, Remote LFA, TI-LFA, the simulation and coverage run unchanged on flexTopology.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 397,
   "width": 748,
   "height": 158,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "              Algorithm 0 (IGP metric)              Algorithm 128 (delay, no red)\n------------  ------------------------------------  -------------------------------------\nS → D         S-E-D, 10 + 10 = 20                   S-A-D, 10 + 10 = 20 µs  (S–E gone)\nprotected     S–E                                   S–A\nLFA B         15 < dist(B,S)+dist(S,D) = 15+20 ✓    50 < dist(B,S)+dist(S,D) = 50+20 ✓\n              downstream 15 < 20 ✓                  downstream 50 < 20 ✗\n              node-prot. 15 < 25+10 ✓               node-prot. 50 < dist(B,A)+dist(A,D)\n                                                               = 60+10 ✓\nTI-LFA        S-B-D  [PrefixSID(D)] = 16005         S-B-D  [PrefixSID(D) in 128] = 17005",
   "originalText": "              Algorithm 0 (IGP metric)              Algorithm 128 (delay, no red)\n------------  ------------------------------------  -------------------------------------\nS → D         S-E-D, 10 + 10 = 20                   S-A-D, 10 + 10 = 20 µs  (S–E gone)\nprotected     S–E                                   S–A\nLFA B         15 < dist(B,S)+dist(S,D) = 15+20 ✓    50 < dist(B,S)+dist(S,D) = 50+20 ✓\n              downstream 15 < 20 ✓                  downstream 50 < 20 ✗\n              node-prot. 15 < 25+10 ✓               node-prot. 50 < dist(B,A)+dist(A,D)\n                                                               = 60+10 ✓\nTI-LFA        S-B-D  [PrefixSID(D)] = 16005         S-B-D  [PrefixSID(D) in 128] = 17005",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a24-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 565,
   "width": 592,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
