   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The sidebar’s Algorithm picker makes the algorithm’s\nnetwork the one on screen. It is read-only, because\nits metrics aren’t the IGP metrics (moving routers\nstill works).",
   "originalText": "The sidebar’s Algorithm picker makes the algorithm’s\nnetwork the one on screen. It is read-only, because\nits metrics aren’t the IGP metrics (moving routers\nstill works).",
